{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00014","headline":"重幸武功 · 太宗皇帝","name":"重幸武功","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"代马依朔吹，惊禽愁昔丛。\n况兹承眷德，怀旧感深衷。\n积善忻余庆，畅武悦成功。\n垂衣天下治，端拱车书同。\n白水巡前迹，丹陵幸旧宫。\n列筵欢故老，高宴聚新丰。\n驻跸抚田畯，回舆访牧童。\n瑞气萦丹阙，祥烟散碧空。\n孤屿含霜白，遥山带日红。\n於焉欢击筑，聊以咏南风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}